<title>UK: ATHLETICS-CHEPCHUMBA WINS WOMEN'S LONDON MARATHON.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-CHEPCHUMBA WINS WOMEN'S LONDON MARATHON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joyce Chepchumba of Kenya won the women's London marathon on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Britain's Liz McColgan came second and Lidia Simon of Romania finished third.</p>
